# D3-EN-008: Selective digestion in a mixed milk-and-gelatin matrix
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 whole_milk 30g
add v1 gelatin 0.5g
add v1 lactase 0.05g
add v2 whole_milk 30g
add v2 gelatin 0.5g
add v2 protease 0.05g
add v3 whole_milk 30g
add v3 gelatin 0.5g
add v3 lactase 0.05g
add v3 protease 0.05g
wait 45min
look v1
look v2
look v3
inspect
